<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (Nutrition Health Question Answering System is my undergraduate thesis project focused on developing an AI powered Question Answering System for the pediatric nutrition domain using Retrieval Augmented Generation \(RAG\). The project was initiated to address the limitation of existing nutrition datasets that only contained question-answer pairs without sufficient contextual information. To overcome this, I implemented Synthetic Context Generation using Large Language Models to automatically generate supporting contexts, enabling the development of a more reliable and context-aware Question Answering system for nutrition professionals.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (My role involved analyzing the needs and system requirements, designing the end-to-end RAG architecture, developing the synthetic context generation pipeline, preparing and processing nutrition datasets, integrating vector databases and Large Language Model APIs, and evaluating the system using quantitative metrics. Through this project, I learned how to develop an end-to-end AI-based information system, integrate multiple technologies into a single workflow, and build reliable solutions through systematic experimentation, iterative development, and comprehensive system evaluation.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
