230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (Momenia Invitation Website Maker is a self-initiated group project developed by Semeton Corp, where I contributed as a Product Designer. The idea came from our observation that Bali has many events, ceremonies, and celebrations that often require digital invitations, but creating an invitation website is usually expensive, manual, or difficult to customize without technical help.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (To solve this, we designed Momenia as an affordable and easy-to-use website builder specifically for digital invitations. The platform helps users create, customize, publish, and manage invitations through editable templates, responsive layouts, add-ons, payment flow, guest management, RSVP tracking, guestbook, after-party notes, and easy deployment. My role involved translating product requirements into user flows, wireframes, high-fidelity interfaces, and responsive design concepts for both user and admin experiences. Through this project, I learned how to turn a local market opportunity into a scalable digital product, structure complex features into a clear user journey and UI/UX, and collaborate with a small startup team to prepare the product for future deployment.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
