<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (Memoribox Photobox System is a freelance client-based group project developed by Semeton Corp for memoribox.id, where I contributed as a Product Designer, Product Manager, and Software Tester. The project started from the need to transform a conventional photobooth experience into a more modern, efficient, and scalable digital system for events and business operations.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (The solution focused on building an self service integrated digital photobooth platform with features such as payment gateway, template selection, photo retake, photo customization, automatic printing, digital photo delivery, cloud storage, admin analytics dashboard, and other configurable features. My role involved gathering client requirements, defining user flows, designing wireframes and high-fidelity interfaces, and supporting User Acceptance Testing with the client. Through this project, I learned how to manage a real client-based product, translate business needs into clear product features, and collaborate with a small startup team to create a scalable, efficient, and user-friendly digital photobooth experience.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
