343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (StuntCare is a group project developed during my internship program at Raion Community, where I collaborated with Product Managers, UI/UX Designers, and Programmers. The project aimed to support pregnant women in preventing stunting from the early pregnancy stage by providing accessible health information, nutrition guidance, pregnancy progress tracking, and supportive digital features.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (My role involved conducting user research with expectant mothers, developing user personas, identifying key user needs, and contributing to the design process from wireframes, high-fidelity designs, to interactive prototypes. Based on the research insights, our team applied a design thinking process to create features such as Anti-Stunting, Procare, and Stream. The project achieved a System Usability Scale result of 81.5%, helping validate the usability of the solution. Through this project, I learned how to collaborate in a multidisciplinary team, work through a structured product development process, and design a health-focused digital solution aligned with the SDGs, especially in supporting maternal and child health.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
